flowchart TD
  A["Tutor sends starting check<br/>DIAG-D, from course card CRS-07"] --> B{"Student has an account?"}
  B -->|"yes"| C["Email NTF-409 and bell<br/>Your check card on Home"]
  B -->|"no email"| D["Personal check link<br/>tutor presses Copy or WhatsApp"]
  C --> E["DIAG-S Start the check"]
  D --> F{"Link valid?"}
  F -->|"expired after 14 days or replaced"| G["This link has expired<br/>Ask your tutor for a new one"]
  G --> H["Tutor Sends again<br/>new link, old link stops at once"]
  H --> D
  F -->|"already finished"| I["You've already finished this check. Thanks"]
  F -->|"more than 10 opens in an hour"| J["Too many tries. Try again in an hour"]
  F -->|"valid"| E
  E --> K["One question at a time<br/>four options plus Not sure<br/>no going back, no score shown"]
  K -->|"Save and finish later"| L["Same link or card resumes<br/>other device continues from last question"]
  L --> K
  K -->|"missed a topic"| M["Later topics in that module are skipped<br/>unless marked as not building on each other"]
  M --> K
  K --> N["All done, thanks"]
  N --> O["Tutor notified NTF-411"]
  O --> P["DIAG-R Results by topic<br/>two right Knows it, two wrong or Not sure Needs work,<br/>mixed Not sure yet"]
  P -->|"unfinished"| Q["Send a reminder NTF-410<br/>email or WhatsApp button"]
  Q --> K
  P --> R["Review changes CRS-08<br/>tutor ticks each proposed status"]
  P --> S["Suggested order card<br/>only when Kavi exists"]
  P -->|"Send again"| A
  P -->|"Cancel this check"| T["Attempt cancelled"]
  U["New student joins the course later"] --> A
